    },
    {
      "displayText": "胖甜妮，\n别不高兴了好不好？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n去吃你常吃的那个嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80D6751C59AEFF0C000A522B4E0D9AD851744E86597D4E0D597DFF1F00100001BE00000A53BB54034F605E385403768490A34E2A561B3002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咘！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5498FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了……这位训练家，\n可以拜托你一件事吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86202620268FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A53EF4EE562DC62584F604E004EF64E8B5417FF1F001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的胖甜妮呀，\n它闹了个小罢工，不好好干活了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768480D6751C59AE5440FF0C000A5B8395F94E864E2A5C0F7F625DE5FF0C4E0D597D597D5E726D3B4E863002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "平时我都会带它去吃\n旭日咖啡馆的那个东西，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但不巧我这里刚好有工作走不开。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E7365F6621190FD4F1A5E265B8353BB5403000A65ED65E5549655619986768490A34E2A4E1C897FFF0C00100001BE00000A4F464E0D5DE762118FD991CC521A597D67095DE54F5C8D704E0D5F003002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，我想拜托你这位\n训练家陪胖甜妮去。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要去旭日咖啡馆的话，\n从南侧大道直走就到。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C621160F362DC62584F608FD94F4D000A8BAD7EC35BB6966A80D6751C59AE53BB300200100001BE01000A898153BB65ED65E554965561998676848BDDFF0C000A4ECE53574FA75927905376F48D705C3152303002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就拜托你在旭日咖啡馆\n陪伴胖甜妮了哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3162DC62584F60572865ED65E5549655619986000A966A4F3480D6751C59AE4E8654E63002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "胖甜妮。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n今天陪你来的不是克里姆，\n但你要点的还是和平时一样对吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
